# Monsoon-X Environment Variables Template
# In Demo Mode, NO ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES OR API KEYS ARE REQUIRED.
# The app works out of the box using:
# - localStorage for saved farms, advisory history, and user data
# - Open-Meteo API for live weather forecasts (free, no API key needed)
# - OpenStreetMap/Leaflet for interactive map picker (free, no API key needed)

# Optional custom backend URL (for future ML models)
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api

# Optional Supabase Credentials (only if you wish to sync data to the cloud later)
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
